# turn 3 and casts Pounce at Bot2 and at that Ornithopter; Bot2 answers with Teferi's Protection, gaining protection from everything
# (it can't be targeted by Pounce any more). The player target is illegal, so no Clue is made - Bot2's battlefield is empty: its
